| Q1 2028 | 28,042.115066 | 0.941441 | 26,400.000 | 16.500% | 4,356.000 |
| Q2 2028 | 28,042.115066 | 1.027027 | 28,800.000 | 16.500% | 4,752.000 |
| Q3 2028 | 28,042.115066 | 1.112612 | 31,200.000 | 16.500% | 5,148.000 |
| Q4 2028 | 28,042.115066 | 1.198198 | 33,600.000 | 16.500% | 5,544.000 |
| Q1 2029 | 28,042.115066 | 0.972822 | 27,280.000 | 17.000% | 4,637.600 |
| Q2 2029 | 28,042.115066 | 1.061261 | 29,760.000 | 17.000% | 5,059.200 |
| Q3 2029 | 28,042.115066 | 1.149699 | 32,240.000 | 17.000% | 5,480.800 |
| Q4 2029 | 28,042.115066 | 1.238138 | 34,720.000 | 17.000% | 5,902.400 |
| Q1 2030 | 28,042.115066 | 0.996359 | 27,940.000 | 17.000% | 4,749.800 |
| Q2 2030 | 28,042.115066 | 1.086937 | 30,480.000 | 17.000% | 5,181.600 |
| Q3 2030 | 28,042.115066 | 1.177515 | 33,020.000 | 17.000% | 5,613.400 |
