## 7. Operating-cost bridge and quarterly operating model

The model includes selling/admin/R&D, business taxes and an impairment allowance. H1 expense burden is 12.0603% of sales, declining to 11.5/11/10.5/10% 2027–30 through scale and mix assumptions. New-business R&D is inside this aggregate investment budget. Finance costs, subsidies and investment gains are excluded consistently. This avoids treating exceptional investment returns as recurring manufacturing profit or adding depreciation back to a profit measure that already includes it.

**Profit basis:** Core GP less operating costs and impairment allowance. Amounts below are CNY millions.

| Quarter | Status | Revenue | GP / contribution | Opex % | Opex | OP margin | Operating profit | Main driver | Confidence |
